  "The file ds.csv has a cell that is not a number: 'abc' ('value' of 'x')."
# ---
# name: test_from_csv_with_cells_that_are_not_numbers[partial-value]
  "The file ds.csv has a variable with a value in some rows only: 'x' (rows 2 and 3); a variable has a value in every row or in none. The file ds.csv has a cell that is not a number: 'abc' ('value' of 'y')."
# ---
# name: test_from_csv_with_cells_that_are_not_numbers[several]
  "The file ds.csv has cells that are not numbers: 'abc' ('lower_bound' of 'x'), 'None' ('upper_bound' of 'x') and '1_0' ('value' of 'y')."
# ---
# name: test_from_csv_with_cells_that_are_not_numbers[underscore]
  "The file ds.csv has a cell that is not a number: '1_0' ('lower_bound' of 'x')."
